@using Microsoft.Extensions.Options
@using Glosify.Services.Legal
@inject IOptions<LegalOptions> Legal
@{
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_GlosifyLayout.cshtml";
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of Service";
    var legal = Legal.Value;
}

<main class="auth-shell legal-shell">
    <article class="glass-card legal-document">
        <header class="auth-card-header"><h1>Terms of Service</h1><p>Effective 10 August 2026</p></header>
        <p>Glosify is a beta language-learning service operated by <strong>@legal.ControllerName</strong>. By using it, you agree to use the service lawfully, keep your account secure, and upload or stream only material you are permitted to process.</p>

        <h2>Beta service and availability</h2>
        <p>Features may change, fail, or be temporarily unavailable. Paid features close when Glosify's monthly application budget is exhausted and reopen at the next Europe/Stockholm monthly period. Credits are service units, have no cash value, and do not guarantee uninterrupted availability.</p>

        <h2>Trial credits</h2>
        <p>An eligible account linked to Google or Microsoft may receive one 25-credit trial. Password-only and API registrations do not receive automatic trial credits. Abuse, duplicate-account farming, automation, or attempts to evade limits may result in suspension.</p>

        <h2>Your content</h2>
        <p>You retain rights in content you provide. You grant Glosify and its processors the limited permission required to host, transmit, analyse, translate, and return that content for the features you request. Do not rely on generated translations or learning material for medical, legal, safety-critical, or other high-stakes decisions.</p>

        <h2>Ending use</h2>
        <p>You may stop using Glosify and delete stored content through the available account and transcript controls. Glosify may restrict accounts that threaten the service, other users, or legal compliance.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:@legal.ContactEmail">@legal.ContactEmail</a>.</p>

        <nav class="legal-links" aria-label="Legal pages"><a asp-action="Privacy">Privacy Policy</a><a asp-action="Support">Support</a></nav>
    </article>
</main>
